  abstract = {A case study demonstrating how a poorly functioning academic was helped to successfully re-organize his life and his work is described. More efficient management of time was the means through which this re-organization took place. Details of effective time-management techniques are given, together with data indicating the value of the approach in producing improved teaching and research performance. Copyright \copyright{} 1982 by Taylor \& Francis Group. All rights reserved.},
